            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 6.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.8.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ni ukuri bashutse ubwoko bwanjye bavuga ngo ‘Ni amahoro’ kandi ari nta yo, kandi iyo hagize uwubaka inkike bayihomesha ishwagara ridakomeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ubwire abayihomesha ishwagara ridakomeye yuko iyo nkike izariduka. Hazagwa imvura y'umurindi, namwe mahindu y'urubura rukomeye muzagwa, maze umuyaga w'umugaru uyisenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dore inkike nigwa, ntimuzi ko muzanegurwa ngo mbese guhoma mwayihomesheje kwagiye he?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cyo gituma Umwami Uwiteka avuga ati “Nzayisenyesha umuyaga w'umugaru mfite uburakari, hazagwa imvura y'umurindi bitewe n'umujinya wanjye, kandi uburakari bwanjye bukaze buzatuma urubura rukomeye ruyitsembaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ko nzasenya inkike mwahomesheje ishwagara ridakomeye, maze nyigushe hasi bitume urufatiro rwayo rutwikururwa. Izagwa namwe mutsemberwemo, kandi muzamenya yuko ndi Uwiteka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uku ni ko nzasohoza uburakari bwanjye ku nkike no ku bayihomesheje ishwagara ridakomeye, kandi nzababwira nti ‘Inkike ntikiriho ndetse n'abayihomye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ari bo bahanuzi ba Isirayeli bahanura iby'i Yerusalemu, bakayibonera iyerekwa ry'amahoro kandi ari nta mahoro.’ Ni ko Umwami Uwiteka avuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nuko nawe mwana w'umuntu, urebeshe abakobwa b'ubwoko bwawe igitsure, bahanura ibyo bibwiye mu mitima yabo, maze ubahanurire uti ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Uku ni ko Umwami Uwiteka avuga ngo: Bazabona ishyano abo bagore bagegena impigi zo kwambika bose mu bizigira, bakabadodera ibitambaro byo gutwikira imitwe yabo, uko umuntu areshya wese kugira ngo bahige ubugingo bwabo! Mbese abantu banjye murahiga ubugingo bwabo ngo mubukize ku bwanyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mwangayishije mu bwoko bwanjye ku bw'ingemu z'amashyi ya sayiri n'intore z'umutsima, kugira ngo mwice ubugingo butari bukwiriye gupfa, murokore ubugingo butari bukwiriye kurokorwa, mu buryo bushuka ubwoko bwanjye butegera amatwi ibinyoma.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni cyo gituma Umwami Uwiteka avuga ati “Dore nibasiye impigi zanyu, izo mutegesha abantu nk'uko nyoni zitegwa. Nzazishikuza ku maboko yanyu maze ndeke ubugingo bw'abantu bwigendere, ubwo bugingo bw'abantu mutega nk'uko inyoni zitegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibitambaro byanyu na byo nzabishwanyaguza nkure ubwoko bwanjye mu maboko yanyu, kandi ntabwo bazongera kuba mu maboko yanyu ngo bahigwe, namwe muzamenya yuko ndi Uwiteka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kuko ibinyoma byanyu ari byo mwateje umutima w'ubukiranutsi agahinda, uwo ntateye agahinda, mugakomeza amaboko y'inkozi y'ibibi kugira ngo idahindukira ikava mu nzira yayo mbi ikabaho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni cyo gituma mutazongera kubona ibyerekanwa by'ubusa cyangwa kuragura ibinyoma, kandi nzarokora ubwoko bwanjye mbuvane mu maboko yanyu, namwe muzamenya yuko ndi Uwiteka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.23"
            ]
